  "bodyHash": "4ea7ddeb53bf2950",
  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/logo.png\" alt=\"朋友&amp;敵人\" width=\"836\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Buy Me a Coffee&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Become a Patron&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=Join Our Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Join Our Discord\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Wiki\"> </a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">Friends&amp;Foes 將從生物投票中落選與被遺忘的生物加入遊戲。主要目標之一是進一步擴展原始概念，並為所有生物添加新的類原生存遊戲特性。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">您可以查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a> 以獲取已實作生物與特性的詳細概覽。</p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:33px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab.gif\" alt=\"螃蟹\" width=\"60\">&nbsp;&nbsp;螃蟹</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\">螃蟹</a>，一種在紅樹林沼澤和海灘上游蕩的友好生物。想要延長你的觸碰距離嗎？蟹鉗可用來製作延長距離的藥水，為你的冒險提供寶貴的優勢。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab#breeding\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁殖</a> 這隻小傢伙，你需要海帶和耐心，因為螃蟹需要將卵「埋」在安全的地方。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcrab_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" alt=\"揮手的螃蟹\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcrab_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" alt=\"螃蟹攀爬紅樹林\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">與螃蟹相關的其它特性：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Craw-Claw\" rel=\"nofollow\">蟹鉗</a> 物品</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Reaching\" rel=\"nofollow\">延長觸碰距離</a> 狀態效果</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:41px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem.gif\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;凝灰岩傀儡</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem\" rel=\"nofollow\">凝灰岩傀儡</a>，一種姿態優雅的生物，可以持有並展示你給它的任何物品，但請注意，當它沒有睡覺時，它喜歡隨意散步。想讓你的凝灰岩傀儡留在原地嗎？用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#glueing\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂巢</a> 把它固定住。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#creation\" rel=\"nofollow\">建造</a> 這位沉睡的美人，請準備一個凝灰岩石塊、任意 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#dyeing\" rel=\"nofollow\">顏色</a> 的羊毛塊和南瓜。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ftuff_golem_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡手持附魔書\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ftuff_golem_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" alt=\"睡眠中的凝灰岩傀儡\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal.gif\" alt=\"搗蛋鬼\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;搗蛋鬼</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">發現 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Rascal\" rel=\"nofollow\">搗蛋鬼</a>，一種藏在礦坑中的調皮小生物，樂於玩捉迷藏。它既愛玩又樂於助人，在你尋找它時會提供線索。找到它三次，它就會獎勵你夢寐以求的背包！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252frascal_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" alt=\"礦坑中的搗蛋鬼\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252frascal_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" alt=\"搗蛋鬼丟出背包\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem.gif\" alt=\"銅傀儡\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;銅傀儡</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">認識 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem\" rel=\"nofollow\">銅傀儡</a>，一種巴掌大小、充滿喜劇色彩的神奇生物，樂於隨機按壓銅按鈕。與其他銅製造物一樣，它會隨時間 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#oxidation\" rel=\"nofollow\">氧化</a>，但別擔心，維護起來輕鬆易行！想快速翻新嗎？拿起 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#scraping\" rel=\"nofollow\">斧頭</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#waxing\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂巢</a> 即可。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#creation\" rel=\"nofollow\">建造</a> 這隻小生物，請準備銅塊、南瓜和避雷針。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcopper_golem_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" alt=\"村莊中的銅傀儡工作站結構\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcopper_golem_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" alt=\"銅傀儡\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">與銅傀儡相關的其它特性：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem-Workstation\" rel=\"nofollow\">銅傀儡工作站</a> 村莊結構</li>\n<li>所有銅變體的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Button\" rel=\"nofollow\">銅按鈕</a></li>\n<li>所有銅變體的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Lightning-Rod\" rel=\"nofollow\">避雷針</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare.webp\" alt=\"瞪視者\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;瞪視者</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare\" rel=\"nofollow\">瞪視者</a>，一種居住在繁茂洞穴中、討厭黑暗的暴躁又可愛苔蘚夥伴。你也厭惡黑暗嗎？如果是這樣，瞪視者可以向你顯示足夠黑暗以生成怪物的區域。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#taming\" rel=\"nofollow\">馴服</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#breeding\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁殖</a> 這隻小可愛，你需要發光莓，但請小心，瞪視者會經常偷吃它們，不會留殘渣。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fglare_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" alt=\"幼年與成年瞪視者\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fglare_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" alt=\"在繁茂洞穴中飛行的瞪視者\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer.webp\" alt=\"冰術師\" width=\"25\">&nbsp;&nbsp;冰術師</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">邂逅 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰術師</a>，一位獨自生活在深雪中的孤獨災厄村民。你可以在樹林中尋找一間小型雲杉木 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">小木屋</a> 來找到他。但在冒險時請多加小心，因為長年野外生活讓他的心比周圍的冰還要寒冷。如果他發現了你，請準備好面對 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">寒冰攻擊</a>，這將使你的冒險變成一場嚴寒挑戰。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ficeologer_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" alt=\"雪地中的冰術師小木屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ficeologer_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" alt=\"攻擊村民的冰術師\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">與冰術師相關的其它特性：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰術師小木屋</a> 結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Freezing\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰封圖騰</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom.webp\" alt=\"花牛\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;花牛</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">隆重推出 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\" rel=\"nofollow\">花牛</a>，一種沐浴在陽光下、披著美麗花朵的牛，主要生活在繁花森林中。這些身披鮮花的夥伴不僅賞心悅目，還能與蜜蜂產生和諧共鳴。當它們穿行時，花牛會留下一串盛開的花徑，讓每一步都成為探索自然奇觀的迷人旅程。</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmoobloom_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" alt=\"金盞花牛花叢\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmoobloom_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" alt=\"繁花牛花叢\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">與牛花叢相關的其他功能：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Buttercup\" rel=\"nofollow\">金盞花</a> 花朵</li>\n<li>所有木質變體的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beehives\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂箱</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper-Area\" rel=\"nofollow\">養蜂人區域</a> 村莊結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" rel=\"nofollow\">養蜂人</a> 村民職業</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire.webp\" alt=\"野火\" width=\"50\">&nbsp;&nbsp;野火</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire\" rel=\"nofollow\">野火</a>，是烈焰人的主宰，身邊由四面盾牌保護。這次遭遇戰絕非善類，請注意它發射的盾牌碎片彈幕以及震動大地的衝擊波攻擊。被逼入死角時，它會召喚烈焰人增援。在你的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">堡壔</a> 領地中征服這項挑戰，運用策略對抗這位火焰哨兵吧。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fwildfire_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" alt=\"下界中的堡壔結構\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fwildfire_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" alt=\"堡壔中的野火\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">與野火相關的其他功能：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">堡壔</a> 結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown\" rel=\"nofollow\">野火皇冠</a> 物品</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown-Fragment\" rel=\"nofollow\">野火皇冠碎片</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler.webp\" alt=\"掠食者\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;掠食者（大飢荒）</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)\" rel=\"nofollow\">掠食者</a>，一種在草原、惡地與沙漠遊蕩的小型掠食者。它們正尋找著雞、兔子等獵物。你可以餵食附魔食物給它們來 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)#storing-and-extracting-experience-points\" rel=\"nofollow\">儲存經驗值</a>，之後再用玻璃瓶提取。但請小心，儲存的經驗值越多，掠食者就會變得越大、越饑渴！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmauler_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" alt=\"追捕雞隻的掠食者\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmauler_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" alt=\"被餵飽的掠食者\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner.webp\" alt=\"幻術師\" width=\"25\">&nbsp;&nbsp;幻術師</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">邂逅 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻術師</a>，一位手持弓箭、狡詐多變的騙術大師，棲息於泰加林。你可以透過搜尋一間小木屋或他的訓練場來找到他。請謹慎接近，因為他的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#casting-blindness\" rel=\"nofollow\">致盲咒語</a> 可能讓你陷入一片漆黑，難以分辨 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#summoning-illusions\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻象</a> 與現實。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fillusioner_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" alt=\"泰加林中的幻術師小屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fillusioner_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" alt=\"訓練場中的幻術師\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">與幻術師相關的其他功能：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner-Shack\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻術師小屋</a> 結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Illusion\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻象圖騰</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse.webp\" alt=\"殭屍馬（陷阱）\" width=\"50\">&nbsp;&nbsp;殭屍馬（陷阱）</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">曾經想騎乘 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Zombie-Horse-(Trap)\" rel=\"nofollow\">殭屍馬</a> 嗎？如果是的話，在暴風雨中靠近它，奇蹟可能會發生 &ndash; 你甚至可能瞥見四騎士的身影.\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fzombie_horse_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" alt=\"暴風雨中的殭屍馬\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fzombie_horse_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" alt=\"暴風雨中的四騎士\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">⚙️ 相容性 / 擴充模組</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">Friends&amp;Foes 設計為與其他所有模組完全相容，目前提供以下擴充模組與數據包：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花牛花叢</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - 養蜂人小屋</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 相容數據包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ctov-friends-and-foes-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">CTOV - Friends and Foes 相容數據包</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">💬 社群</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 Discord 社群伺服器</a> 進行交流、分享你的創作、提出任何問題，或單純追蹤模組的最新開發動態並在新版本釋出時獲得通知。也請不吝 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">透過 GitHub Issues 回報任何當機或錯誤</a>。</p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">👋 支援</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">我會繼續將開發模組視為興趣，因為我真心享受其中。如果你希望支持我，可以透過 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a>。非常感謝你的支持。</p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">📜 授權條款</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組採用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252fLICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 授權條款。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎自由瀏覽我的程式碼，了解我在開發此模組時如何應對並解決各種挑戰。你可以自由將程式碼片段融入你自己的專案中。也歡迎將此模組用於任何模組整合包中（若能註明出處或連結回本頁面將不勝感激）。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">你也可以查看包含所有模型與調色板的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/blockbench\" rel=\"nofollow\">blockbench 資料夾</a>，以及存放貼圖的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/friendsandfoes/textures\" rel=\"nofollow\">textures 資料夾</a>。歡迎汲取靈感，但請不要直接複製貼上當作自己的作品。</p>",
